00:16:21,180 --> 00:16:22,800
还有我的手机
And my phone.

355
00:16:28,420 --> 00:16:29,870
还有  我是德州人
Also, I'm from Texas,

356
00:16:29,870 --> 00:16:33,140
我能尝得出兔肉和松鼠肉的区别
and I can taste the difference between rabbit and squirrel.

357
00:16:41,520 --> 00:16:43,370
看谁重返人间啦
Oh, look who's back!

358
00:16:43,370 --> 00:16:44,550
她醒了
There she is!

359
00:16:44,550 --> 00:16:46,780
发生了什么  我们怎么到这儿的
What happened? How did we get here?

360
00:16:47,490 --> 00:16:48,710
你什么都不记得了吗
You don't remember anything?

361
00:16:48,710 --> 00:16:51,960
我记得喝了一些烈酒  然后
I remember taking some shots, and then...

362
00:16:52,280 --> 00:16:53,620
就断片了
that's it.

363
00:16:54,260 --> 00:16:56,200
天啊  我醉倒了吗
Oh, my gosh, did I pass out?

364
00:16:56,200 --> 00:16:57,370
貌似是的
You kind of did.

365
00:16:57,370 --> 00:16:59,010
在我自己的单身女郎派对上吗
At my own bachelorette party?

366
00:16:59,010 --> 00:17:01,010
我真是逊爆了
I'm so lame.

367
00:17:01,790 --> 00:17:03,720
你醉倒前还是做了
Well, you didn't pass out before you did

368
00:17:03,720 --> 00:17:05,330
各种好玩的事呀
all kinds of fun stuff.

369
00:17:05,330 --> 00:17:06,360
我做了什么
What did I do?

370
00:17:06,370 --> 00:17:08,560
你做了什么啊
What did you do?

371
00:17:09,690 --> 00:17:11,290
她做了什么
What'd she do?

372
00:17:14,180 --> 00:17:18,260
爱尔兰传统踢踏舞舞剧

373
00:17:14,180 --> 00:17:18,260
你不记得在吧台上跳《大河之舞》了吗
well, you don't remember Riverdancing on top of the bar?

374
00:17:22,920 --> 00:17:24,020
我跳了吗
I did that?

375
00:17:24,020 --> 00:17:25,870
当然了
Yeah, you did!

376
00:17:27,130 --> 00:17:29,400
但我不会跳《大河之舞》啊
But I don't know how to Riverdance.

377
00:17:29,740 --> 00:17:33,470
那也没能拦住你教那些半裸的消防员
Didn't stop you from teaching all those shirtless firemen.

378
00:17:35,150 --> 00:17:37,590
我看见半裸消防员了吗
I saw shirtless firemen?

379
00:17:37,590 --> 00:17:40,530
看见  闻过  还把他们当钢管滑下来
Saw, smelled, slid down like a pole.

380
00:17:42,180 --> 00:17:43,810
我有没有露奶给某人看
Did I flash anybody?

381
00:17:43,810 --> 00:17:46,380
应该问有没有给所有人看
How about everybody?

382
00:17:47,910 --> 00:17:50,600
真不敢相信  我觉得好羞愧
I can't believe it. I'm so embarrassed.

383
00:17:50,600 --> 00:17:52,520
你们没拍照吧
You didn't take any pictures, did you?

384
00:17:52,520 --> 00:17:54,120
我们绝不会那样对你
Oh, no, we would never do that to you.

385
00:17:54,120 --> 00:17:55,570
对啊  但如果有照片
Yeah. But if there were pictures,

386
00:17:55,570 --> 00:17:58,060
一定狂野极了
they would be crazy.

387
00:17:59,430 --> 00:18:01,870
你们真是我的好朋友
You guys are good friends.

388
00:18:13,560 --> 00:18:16,020
晚饭来啦
Dinner!

389
00:18:17,610 --> 00:18:19,060
人呢
Guys?

390
00:18:21,640 --> 00:18:24,840
他们竟然不告而别
I can't believe they left without saying good-bye.

391
00:18:24,930 --> 00:18:27,740
等一下  万一他们窃取了我的研究呢
Wait a minute, what if they stole my work?

392
00:18:27,740 --> 00:18:30,110
等一下
Wait a minute!

393
00:18:30,190 --> 00:18:32,380
万一他们根本没来过呢
What if they were never here at all?

394
00:18:32,950 --> 00:18:34,560
等一下
Wait a minute!

395
00:18:34,620 --> 00:18:36,400
万一他们还没来到
What if they haven't gotten here yet

396
00:18:36,400 --> 00:18:39,040
但已经在路上了呢
but they're on their way?!

397
00:18:39,490 --> 00:18:41,610
我还是赶紧收拾收拾
I better tidy up.

398
00:18:52,030 --> 00:18:53,350
你好啊
Hello.

399
00:18:53,350 --> 00:18:55,510
欢迎回家  怎么样了
Welcome back. How'd it go?

400
00:18:55,690 --> 00:18:58,230
沃尔科特博士关于时间的理论
Well, Dr. Wolcott's theories of time

401
00:18:58,240 --> 00:19:01,470
或许能拯救我对弦理论的新解读
might save my new interpretation of string theory.

402
00:19:01,470 --> 00:19:03,530
真令人激动
Oh, well, that's exciting.

403
00:19:03,530 --> 00:19:04,600
确实
It is.

404
00:19:04,600 --> 00:19:06,660
你的单身女郎派对怎么样
How was your bachelorette party?

405
00:19:06,660 --> 00:19:09,650
我到酒吧去了
Well, I was in a bar,

406
00:19:09,670 --> 00:19:11,950
还看到一些半裸的男人
and I saw some shirtless men.

407
00:19:12,260 --> 00:19:14,890
他们是消防员  为我展开了激烈的争夺
They were firemen, and they fought over me.

408
00:19:16,720 --> 00:19:18,160
但在胜利者得到我送的战利品前
But Penny and Bernadette got me out of there

409
00:19:18,160 --> 00:19:21,060
佩妮和伯纳黛特就把我带走了
before the victor got my spoils.

410
00:19:23,380 --> 00:19:24,760
知道了
I see.

411
00:19:25,620 --> 00:19:26,820
怎么了
What's the matter?

412
00:19:26,820 --> 00:19:28,280
你好像闷闷不乐的
You look glum.

413
00:19:29,240 --> 00:19:32,200
艾米  如果我不是你以为的那种人
Amy, would you still love me

414
00:19:32,200 --> 00:19:34,700
你还会爱我吗
if I wasn't who you thought I was?

415
00:19:34,700 --> 00:19:36,230
你在说什么呢
What are you talking about?

416
00:19:36,230 --> 00:19:38,720
如果我其实不是
Well, what if it turns out

417
00:19:38,720 --> 00:19:43,010
你当初爱上的那个专心致志  沉迷科学
I'm not the single-minded, science-obsessed recluse

418
00:19:43,010 --> 00:19:45,860
把研究看得比一切人事物都重要的隐士
who puts his work above everything and everybody else

419
00:19:45,860 --> 00:19:47,760
怎么办
that you fell in love with?

420
00:19:50,860 --> 00:19:53,180
如果我不是你以为的那个
What if I'm not the straightlaced,

421
00:19:53,180 --> 00:19:56,270
严厉刻板  沉默寡言的缝被女王  怎么办
buttoned-up, quilting queen you thought I was?

422
00:19:57,220 --> 00:19:58,860
如果我是个
What if I'm a...

423
00:19:58,860 --> 00:20:00,970
跳《大河之舞》的狂野女人呢
Riverdancing wild woman?

424
00:20:08,300 --> 00:20:09,910
我依然会爱你
I'd still love you.

425
00:20:09,910 --> 00:20:11,810
我也依然会爱你
I'd still love you, too.

426
00:20:14,120 --> 00:20:16,410
你真的会跳《大河之舞》吗
Do you really know how to Riverdance?

427
00:20:23,230 --> 00:20:24,690
你来告诉我啊
You tell me.

428
00:20:36,670 --> 00:20:39,110
你不许跳给其他男人看
I'm the only man you do that for.

